{"id":"p0ttt7o624zp51x44jf6vl60i","title":"餐厅小份菜定价策略：非四舍五入价格更吸引顾客","originalTitle":"Secret to selling small plates at restaurants: Nonrounded pricing","summary":"美国俄亥俄州立大学的研究发现，小份菜价格以非四舍五入的数字（如 .99）定价，能增加顾客认为价格公平并下单的可能性。研究显示，这种定价策略不仅有助于增加销售，还能让顾客感到更满意。该研究发表在《酒店与旅游管理杂志》上。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-secret-small-plates-restaurants-nonrounded.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T19:40:28.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T19:43:35.760Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T19:43:35.760Z","category":"clinical","tags":["论文发表","研究成果"],"score":37,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"dd20a001-52a3-457b-b3c9-855e102ec64b","title":"俄亥俄州立大学研究：非四舍五入定价提升小份菜品销售与顾客满意度"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"dd20a001-52a3-457b-b3c9-855e102ec64b","title":"俄亥俄州立大学研究：非四舍五入定价提升小份菜品销售与顾客满意度"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"f6oDAWuNxhF0","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}